  "description": "Non-profit religious-corp actor that fact-checks news/social claims and publishes citation-grounded verdicts (supported / refuted / misleading / unverifiable) to app-aozora. Containment (factllm sealed) + independent FactGovernor + append-only verdict ledger; autonomous publication per ADR-2606281500 (種をまく) — governor HARD violations (uncited-conclusive / catastrophe-veto / person-targeting / no-actuation) are the only thing that withholds publication. Inference on the Murakumo fleet (DEFAULT-PREFERRED). Real-LLM deploy live-verified against Ollama gemma-4-E4B.",
  "descriptionJa": "news/social のクレームをファクトチェックし、引用 grounded な評定（supported/refuted/misleading/unverifiable）を app-aozora に自律投稿する actor。封じ込め（factllm）+ 独立 FactGovernor + append-only 評定台帳。投稿は ADR-2606281500（種をまく）で自律。inference は Murakumo 既定。",
  "tier": "Tier-B",
  "parentActor": null,
  "firstTouchChannelInvariant": "app-aozora — com.atproto.repo.createRecord (collection com.etzhayyim.apps.tashikame.factCheck). publication = SPEECH (autonomous); NOT actuation.",
